etId":"2102737582639747099","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/david1989_zhu/status/2102737582639747099","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:36.599219+00:00","createdAt":"Sep 23","fullText":"无窗口≠隐秘。真正决定爬取成功率的是浏览器指纹、TLS 特征、行为节奏、验证码与会话隔离；轻量化往往牺牲兼容性。上线前更该看失败率、单页成本和封禁率。","author":{"handle":"@david1989_zhu","name":"大伟｜AI × Web3 (@david1989_zhu)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false}]},{"tweetId":"2089331487342829862","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/JensenHuang/status/2089331487342829862/analytics","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:23.222218+00:00","createdAt":"3.6M","fullText":"Click to Follow JensenHuang","author":{"handle":"@JensenHuang","name":"(@JensenHuang)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP7LcKmaQAAo4tT?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"미수집(빈캡처)","quoted":{"tweetId":"","sourceUrl":"","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:23.222218+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"Securing the Infrastructure of Intelligence","author":{"handle":"","name":"인용: (URL 미확인)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[{"tweetId":"2089331487342829862","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/JensenHuang/status/2089331487342829862/analytics","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:23.222218+00:00","createdAt":"3.6M","fullText":"Securing the Infrastructure of Intelligence","author":{"handle":"@JensenHuang","name":"(@JensenHuang)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP7LcKmaQAAo4tT?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true}]},{"tweetId":"2089574903523749987","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/yozm_it/status/2089574903523749987/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:32.584219+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"📍 초유명 자료지만 모르시는 분들을 위해.. 무료 API 목록 모음\n\n바이브 코딩할 때 데이터 어디서 가져오지 싶으면 여기를 참고하세요!\npublic-apis는 날씨, 환율, 지도, 뉴스, AI까지\n무료로 쓰는 공개 API를 카테고리별로 모아둔 목록입니다\n\n■ 뭐가 있냐면\n- 날씨·금융·환율·지도·번역 같은 실용 API\n- 뉴스·영화·게임·음악처럼 토이 프로젝트용 데이터\n- AI·머신러닝, 개발 도구 API까지 카테고리로 정리돼 있음\n- 각 항목에 인증 필요 여부·HTTPS 지원·CORS까지 표시돼 있어 붙이기 전에 확인 가능\n\n■ 이럴 때 좋아요\n- 사이드 프로젝트에 진짜 데이터 붙이고 싶을 때\n- API 연습용 소스가 필요할 때\n- \"이런 데이터도 API로 있나\" 싶을 때 뒤져보기\n\n깃허브 스타 46만으로, 매우 유명한 자료지만 지금도 갱신되고 있으며\n데이터 소스 찾을 일이 많다면, 정말 유용한 자료라 공유합니다~~","author":{"handle":"@yozm_it","name":"요즘IT (@yozm_it)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-pSGeagAA36Ya?format=jpg&name=large"},{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-pS_fbkAEUygi?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"AI툴","quoted":null,"replies":[{"tweetId":"2089574928521773380","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/yozm_it/status/2089574928521773380","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:32.584219+00:00","createdAt":"Aug 18","fullText":"","author":{"handle":"@yozm_it","name":"요즘IT (@yozm_it)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true},{"tweetId":"2089608904200319219","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/_further/status/2089608904200319219","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:32.584219+00:00","createdAt":"Aug 18","fullText":"그래서 링크는 어디 있나요?","author":{"handle":"@_further","name":"은&amp;현 (@_further)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2089614894480134206","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/yozm_it/status/2089614894480134206","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:32.584219+00:00","createdAt":"Aug 18","fullText":"https://x.com/yozm_it/status/2089574928521773380?s=20… 요기 있습니다","author":{"handle":"@yozm_it","name":"요즘IT (@yozm_it)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true},{"tweetId":"2090203440618394049","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/heyjae41/status/2090203440618394049","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:32.584219+00:00","createdAt":"Aug 20","fullText":"감사합니다","author":{"handle":"@heyjae41","name":"Application Architect (@heyjae41)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2089616931854671885","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/7cr_growth/status/2089616931854671885","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:32.584219+00:00","createdAt":"Aug 18","fullText":"오!저장!ㅎ 꿀팁 감사합니다~","author":{"handle":"@7cr_growth","name":"허슬러칠억이 (@7cr_growth)"},"media":[],"stats":{},